<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1138" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδάκρ-ῡτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without tears</i>:
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>tearless</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ ἀπήμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.415
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				24.61
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδακρύτω ἔχεν ὄσσε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.186
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστένακτος κἀ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				1200
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐνάζειν ἀ. βλεφάρων πόθον</span>
			<i>so that they weep not</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				106
			</span></i> (lyr.):—Medic., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ.
				ὀφθαλμός</span>
			<i>abnormally dry</i>, Aet. <i><span class="en">
				7.91
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c.gen.,
				<i>not weeping for</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					241a13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>unwept</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				881
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>costing no tears</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόπαια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Tim.</u>
					37
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
